## 1. System Context & Layer Breakdown

| Layer | Technology | Primary Responsibilities |
|---|---|---|
| **Presentation / UI** | {{UI_TECH}} | Rendering views, user interactions, local reactive state |
| **Business / Service** | {{SERVICE_TECH}} | Domain logic, financial/mathematical calculations, workflows |
| **Data / Persistence** | {{DATA_TECH}} | LocalStorage / IndexedDB / ORM / Database models |
| **External Integration** | {{INTEGRATION_TECH}} | Third-party REST APIs, messaging, auth providers |

