## 2. Reverse-Engineered Data Flow

```mermaid
graph TD
    UI[UI Layer / Components] -->|Invokes Services| Service[Business Logic / Services]
    Service -->|Validates & Processes| Domain[Domain Logic]
    Domain -->|Persists Data| Storage[Database / Storage Layer]
    Storage -->|Encrypted Ciphertext| Storage
```

---

## 3. Security & Zero-Trust Policies
- **Data Protection**: All client-side storage must be encrypted or sanitized.
- **Access Control**: State transitions must be validated before persistence.
- **XSS Mitigation**: Input strings must be sanitized prior to rendering.

---

## 4. GitFlow & Branching Model
- `main` $\rightarrow$ Production release state.
- `dev` $\rightarrow$ Active integration state.
- `feature/{{feature-name}}` $\rightarrow$ Isolated feature development.
- `bugfix/{{bug-name}}` $\rightarrow$ Targeted patch fixes.
